<title>CHILE: Chile August-Oct unemployment falls to 6.2 pct.</title>
<headline>Chile August-Oct unemployment falls to 6.2 pct.</headline>
<dateline>SANTIAGO 1996-12-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Chile's unemployment rate fell to 6.2 percent in the August-October quarter from 6.8 percent in the July-September period, said the National Statistics Institute.</p>
<p>Areas with the highest unemployment include the southern Eighth Region at 7.3 percent, Santiago at seven percent and the central Fifth Region, which reported a jobless rate of 6.6 percent.</p>
<p>-- Margaret Orgill, Santiago newsroom, 562-699-5595x212</p>
</text>
